  .itm-pg-picker__sort-btn:hover { color: #131313; }
  {%- comment -%}
    font-weight: 900 (not a made-up 800) — this theme's self-hosted
    Montserrat only has real 400/700/900 weight files; anything else
    renders as a synthetic faux-bold that looks subtly off.
